AnyPII
Copyright 2026 AnyPII contributors.

AnyPII is an independent C++ implementation of policy-driven PII redaction.
The prompt layout and logit-readout architecture are inspired by the System One
line of work:

  ifreflex.cpp - https://github.com/DreamBlooms/ifreflex.cpp (MIT)
  reflex       - https://github.com/kshetrajna12/reflex (MIT)
  SemIf-OpenJev- https://github.com/TheoLeeCJ/SemIf-OpenJev (MIT)

No source code from those projects is linked into AnyPII.

Third-party components:

  llama.cpp     - https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp (MIT)
  cpp-httplib   - https://github.com/yhirose/cpp-httplib (MIT)
  nlohmann/json - https://github.com/nlohmann/json (MIT)

The default model is Qwen3.5-0.8B, developed by the Qwen team at Alibaba Cloud.
Model weights are separate artifacts with their own terms and are not
distributed with this repository. Reference names do not imply endorsement by
their authors.
